  q="(E; tranche sizes not disclosed, equal split assumed): one Microsoft tranche ≈ $1.93B TCV ≈ $0.39B/yr = ~3% of FY27 revenue, i.e. −$7.6/share at 5.66x, plus LDs and possible refund of ~$0.77B of upfront cash. Three tranches would be ≈ −$23/share. Microsoft at ~$3.5B/yr is ~28% of FY27 consensus revenue.",
